# Cipher encodes a card "on a creature you control" (CR 702.99a), chosen as the spell resolves; the ruling adds that a
# noncreature permanent has to be a creature before the spell starts resolving. Bot1 turns Creeping Tar Pit into a creature
# land first, then casts Trait Doctoring at Bot2's Forest. Offered as the creature to encode on: the Tar Pit. Not offered:
# Bot1's Island or Mox Jet (noncreature permanents), and Bot2's Llanowar Elves (a creature, but not Bot1's). The card goes
# to exile encoded on the Tar Pit, not to the graveyard, and it stays encoded when the Tar Pit stops being a creature at
# end of turn (CR 702.99c).

